abstract: >-
  XMECK-AI is a Windows private-first personal intelligence workspace combining
  local intelligence, Projects/Git, Knowledge/RAG, explicit local/connected routing,
  bounded Work modes, ProjectGuard authority, Activity/Evidence and recoverable
  product lifecycle under one product identity.
